<section class="bk-cta" aria-labelledby="bookings-cta-title"><div class="bk-shell"><div class="bk-cta__panel"><p class="bk-label">Start with a bookable service</p><h2 id="bookings-cta-title">Give customers an easier way to book while your calendar stays clear.</h2><p>Set up services, working hours, and availability, then let customers choose an eligible appointment.</p><div class="bk-actions"><Button href="/get-started"><span>Start free trial</span><BookingsIcon name="arrow-right"/></Button><Button href="/product" variant="secondary">Explore all features</Button></div><ul><li>Simple setup</li><li>Customer self-booking</li><li>Business-controlled availability</li></ul></div></div></section>
